1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,490
Why did Ravan... cut off his own heads?

2
00:00:02,970 --> 00:00:05,537
Not one... but nine! And then...

3
00:00:05,537 --> 00:00:06,740
they grew back!

4
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:10,039
Ravan's first name was Dashagreev...

5
00:00:10,039 --> 00:00:13,240
because he was born with ten heads and twenty arms.

6
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:17,194
One day, his mother Kaikasi pointed to the sky...

7
00:00:17,194 --> 00:00:19,393
shining in the Pushpak chariot...

8
00:00:19,393 --> 00:00:21,924
your elder brother, Kuber! She said...

9
00:00:21,924 --> 00:00:22,990
become like him.

10
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:25,715
Ravan burned with envy! He swore...

11
00:00:25,715 --> 00:00:27,890
I will be greater than Kuber!

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,945
Penance began at Gokarna.

13
00:00:29,945 --> 00:00:32,280
Ten thousand years... no food.

14
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:35,159
And every thousand years... Ravan offered...

15
00:00:35,159 --> 00:00:36,670
one head... to the fire!

16
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:40,520
Nine thousand years... nine heads.

17
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:43,116
As his hand rose to the tenth head...

18
00:00:43,116 --> 00:00:44,470
Lord Brahma appeared!

19
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:47,382
Ravan asked for immortality. Brahma said...

20
00:00:47,382 --> 00:00:48,740
that cannot be given.

21
00:00:48,850 --> 00:00:51,075
[Ravan] Then grant me this boon...

22
00:00:51,075 --> 00:00:55,268
let no god, demon, serpent, yaksha or rakshasa...

23
00:00:55,268 --> 00:00:56,380
ever kill me.

24
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,777
[Ravan] Humans? To me...

25
00:00:57,777 --> 00:01:00,170
they are like blades of grass!

26
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:02,760
[Brahma] Tathastu. (So be it.)

27
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:05,620
And Ravan's nine heads... grew back!

28
00:01:07,190 --> 00:01:10,120
But the head of pride... he never cut.

29
00:01:10,250 --> 00:01:13,052
That same pride saw humans as grass...

30
00:01:13,052 --> 00:01:16,002
and at the hands of a human, Shri Ram...

31
00:01:16,002 --> 00:01:17,330
Ravan met his end.

